sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Gateway
    participant L as Lambda
    participant B as Bedrock
    participant S as S3
    participant W as CloudWatch

    C->>A: POST /code-generation
    A->>L: Invoke function
    L->>W: Execution logs
    L->>B: Invoke model
    B-->>L: Generated code
    L->>S: PutObject
    S-->>L: Object stored
    L-->>A: HTTP response
    A-->>C: 200 OK
